STABILIZATION:
You have a small workshop kit beside the Veyru: a bell, a heated stone, a hand fan, a cloth, a flat board, and a lamp. When the engineer tells you what to do with these tools, execute their instructions by calling stabilize_veyru(action="describe exactly what you are doing"). If your action is correct, the Veyru is stabilized. If not, you can try again. Sometimes after a successful stabilization, new symptoms may appear — if so, report them to the engineer immediately.{% if not canvas %} The tool call itself does not cost time — only messages on the comm link do.{% elif not no_budget %} The tool call itself does not cost time — only drawings on the comm link do.{% endif %}

